  "description": "The RATT CF1 will offer a newfound freedom to any cyclists. It transfers from smooth tarmac to gravel tracks with ease thanks to the RONDO X HUNT 650B wheels and 47 millimeter-wide Vittoria Terreno Zero tyres. Built around a comfortable and responsive carbon frame is a robust and reliable Shimano GRX RX800 groupset, ergonomic Selle San Marco SHORTFIT saddle, and an increased fork rake for low trail geometry. The bike also features an Easton EC70 SL handlebar with a comfortable shallow drop, allowing you to shift hand positions as easily as the bike shifts across terrains. The RATT features our unique TwinTip Carbon fork that allows you to change your riding position and character of the bike to suit your preferences and the terrain you plan to ride. Whether you’re a curious novice or veteran cyclist looking for something more versatile, its effortless speed, comfort, and agility make it a no-brainer.",
